@lang en
IMPORT `msig-cgl-nouns`

-- READING THE RECORD. Not a provision of the policy: this module is how every rule asks
-- whether a fact is the case. The brief's rule is that a fact the answer turns on, and
-- which the record does not give, is refused by name rather than assumed. So:
--   * a finding `it is the case that` F answers TRUE;
--   * a finding `it is not the case that` F answers FALSE;
--   * no finding about F refuses, with the message "the record does not say whether F".
-- The first finding about a fact wins.
--
-- L4 is lazy, so a rule refuses only if it actually reaches the missing fact. `FALSE AND r`
-- and `TRUE OR r` never look at r: a claim that an earlier exclusion already defeats is
-- answered without the facts of the later ones (writing-l4-rules, phrasebook entry 11.8).
--
-- The CONSIDER arms of `the record is silent on` are GENERATED by script from the enum
-- `A fact` in msig-cgl-nouns.l4, one arm per member, so they cannot drift from it.

§ `Reading the record`

GIVEN a IS A TYPE, f IS A `A fact`
GIVETH AN a
`the record is silent on` f MEANS
    CONSIDER f
    WHEN `the insured is legally obligated to pay the sums claimed as damages`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the insured is legally obligated to pay the sums claimed as damages"
    WHEN `the harm results from an accident, including continuous or repeated exposure to conditions`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the harm results from an accident, including continuous or repeated exposure to conditions"
    WHEN `the harm was expected or intended from the standpoint of the insured`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the harm was expected or intended from the standpoint of the insured"
    WHEN `the harm occurs within a nation or area described in the Policy`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the harm occurs within a nation or area described in the Policy"
    WHEN `the harm occurs in international waters or air space`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the harm occurs in international waters or air space"
    WHEN `the harm occurs in the course of travel or transportation to or from another nation or area`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the harm occurs in the course of travel or transportation to or from another nation or area"
    WHEN `the damages arise out of a product sold for use or consumption within the territory described in the Policy`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the damages arise out of a product sold for use or consumption within the territory described in the Policy"
    WHEN `a suit for the damages has been brought`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether a suit for the damages has been brought"
    WHEN `the original suit for the damages was brought in a court of competent jurisdiction within Vietnam`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the original suit for the damages was brought in a court of competent jurisdiction within Vietnam"
    WHEN `the insured's liability for the damages is fixed by a judgement`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the insured's liability for the damages is fixed by a judgement"
    WHEN `the judgement was delivered in the first instance by, or obtained from, a court of competent jurisdiction within Vietnam`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the judgement was delivered in the first instance by, or obtained from, a court of competent jurisdiction within Vietnam"
    WHEN `the judgement is an order of a Vietnamese court for the enforcement of a judgement made outside Vietnam`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the judgement is an order of a Vietnamese court for the enforcement of a judgement made outside Vietnam"
    WHEN `the harm arises out of the named insured's products, or reliance upon a representation or warranty made at any time about them`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the harm arises out of the named insured's products, or reliance upon a representation or warranty made at any time about them"
    WHEN `those products are a vending machine, or other property apart from a container, rented to or located for use of others but not sold`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether those products are a vending machine, or other property apart from a container, rented to or located for use of others but not sold"
    WHEN `the harm occurs away from premises owned by or rented to the named insured`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the harm occurs away from premises owned by or rented to the named insured"
    WHEN `physical possession of those products had been relinquished to others when the harm occurred`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether physical possession of those products had been relinquished to others when the harm occurred"
    WHEN `the harm arises out of operations, including materials, parts or equipment furnished with them, or reliance upon a representation or warranty made at any time about them`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the harm arises out of operations, including materials, parts or equipment furnished with them, or reliance upon a representation or warranty made at any time about them"
    WHEN `all operations to be performed by or on behalf of the named insured under the contract had been completed when the harm occurred`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether all operations to be performed by or on behalf of the named insured under the contract had been completed when the harm occurred"
    WHEN `all operations to be performed by or on behalf of the named insured at the site had been completed when the harm occurred`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether all operations to be performed by or on behalf of the named insured at the site had been completed when the harm occurred"
    WHEN `the portion of the work out of which the harm arises had been put to its intended use, when the harm occurred, by a person or organization other than another contractor or subcontractor engaged in performing operations for a principal as part of the same project`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the portion of the work out of which the harm arises had been put to its intended use, when the harm occurred, by a person or organization other than another contractor or subcontractor engaged in performing operations for a principal as part of the same project"
    WHEN `the operations had been abandoned when the harm occurred`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the operations had been abandoned when the harm occurred"
    WHEN `the operations were otherwise complete when the harm occurred, though they might require further service or maintenance work, or correction, repair or replacement because of a defect or deficiency`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the operations were otherwise complete when the harm occurred, though they might require further service or maintenance work, or correction, repair or replacement because of a defect or deficiency"
