    WHEN `the insured may be held liable as a person or organization engaged in the business of manufacturing, distributing, selling or serving alcoholic beverages`
        THEN REFUSE "the record does not say whether the insured may be held liable as a person or organization engaged in the business of manufacturing, distributing, selling or serving alcoholic beverages"
    WHEN `the insured may be held liable, not being so engaged, as an owner or lessor of premises used for such purposes`
